--- !u!114 &52686653
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 52686651}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "I. Components\r\n\r\n- Game board: A square divided into 4 colors (red,
    blue, yellow, green), each corner is a \u201Cstable\u201D for horses.\r\n\r\n-
    Pieces: Each player has 4 pieces of the same color.\r\n\r\n- Dice: 1 die is used.\r\n\r\n-
    Number of players: 2\u20134 players.\r\n\r\nII. Objective\r\n\r\n- Bring all
    4 of your horses from the starting stable \u2192 around the board \u2192 to the
    finish (center square) as fast as possible.\r\n\r\nIII. How to Play\r\n\r\n1.
    Starting the game\r\n\r\n- Players take turns rolling the die.\r\n\r\n- To release
    a horse from the stable, you must roll a 6.\r\n\r\n2. Moving pieces\r\n\r\n-
    Each turn, roll the die once and move your horse the corresponding number of
    steps.\r\n\r\n- If you roll a 6:\r\n\r\n- You get an extra roll (can continue
    chaining if you roll more 6s).\r\n\r\n- You may either release a new horse or
    move one already on the board.\r\n\r\n- Horses move anticlockwise around the
    board, following their color\u2019s path.\r\n\r\n3. Capturing (kicking horses)\r\n\r\n-
    If your horse lands on a square occupied by an opponent\u2019s horse, the opponent
    is kicked back to their stable and must roll the required number to re-enter.\r\n\r\n-
    A square may hold only 1 horse.\r\n\r\n4. Entering the home stretch\r\n\r\n-
    After completing a full round, a horse enters its color\u2019s straight path
    to the finish.\r\n\r\n- To enter exactly, the die roll must match the remaining
    steps. If the roll is too high \u2192 wait for the next turn.\r\n\r\n5. Winning\r\n\r\n-
    A player must bring all 4 horses to the finish.\r\n\r\n- The first player to
    do so wins.\r\n\r\n- The game can continue until all players finish to determine
    1st\u20134th place.\r\n\r\nIV. Summary\r\n\r\n- Roll the die \u2192 move according
    to the number.\r\n\r\n- Release horses with 6.\r\n\r\n- Captured horses return
    to the stable.\r\n\r\n- Horses must reach the finish with an exact roll.\r\n\r\n-
    The first to bring all 4 horses home wins.\r\n\r\nV. Funny Mode (Optional Advanced
    Rules)\r\n\r\nIn this mode, random effect tiles spawn across the board. Landing
    on an effect tile triggers one random effect:\r\n\r\n- Move forward 1\u20135
    extra steps.\r\n\r\n- Move backward 1\u20135 steps.\r\n\r\n- Return to base.\r\n\r\n-
    Teleport back to the spawn point.\r\n\r\n- Auto-release a horse from base (if
    possible, obeying capture/block rules).\r\n\r\n- Spin in place for a short time.\r\n\r\n-
    Gain a temporary shield (immune to capture once).\r\n\r\n- Gain a bomb: if captured,
    both attacker and victim return to base.\r\n\r\n(Shield + bomb interactions resolve
    differently depending on who has which)\r\n\r\n- Send a random opponent\u2019s
    horse to base.\r\n\r\n- Swap position with a random opponent\u2019s horse.\r\n\r\n-
    Replace a random opponent\u2019s horse with your own, sending theirs to base.\r\n\r\n-
    Force a random opponent\u2019s horse to move forward 1\u20135 steps.\r\n\r\n-
    Force a random opponent\u2019s horse to move backward 1\u20135 steps.\r\n\r\n(If
    an effect moves a horse onto another effect tile, new effects will continue until
    it stops on a non-effect square)\r\n\r\nThank you! <3"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4a4db228c021f9c448f09e35672a7c3e, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 6988153637822679061, guid: 4a4db228c021f9c448f09e35672a7c3e, type: 2}
