  m_text: "General Terms and Conditions\n\n1. Acceptance of Terms\n\nBy participating
    in the Ludo game, players agree to comply with all of these terms.\n\nIf you
    do not agree, please discontinue using the game.\n\n2. Player Eligibility\n\nPlayers
    must be of legal age as required by the laws of their country/region to play
    the game.\n\nPlayers are responsible for the use of their own devices, internet
    connection, and any associated costs.\n\n3. Rules of Play\n\nPlayers must follow
    the official Ludo rules provided in the in-game Guide/Tutorial.\n\nAny form of
    cheating, use of third-party software, or exploiting bugs/glitches to gain an
    advantage is strictly prohibited.\n\nPlayers must not disrupt, harass, or engage
    in any behavior that negatively impacts the experience of others.\n\n4. Accounts
    and Data\n\nPlayers are responsible for keeping their account information secure
    (if any).\n\nIn-game data (including achievements, scores, virtual items) is
    for entertainment purposes only and has no real-world monetary value.\n\n5. Responsibilities
    and Limitations\n\nThe game is provided \u201Cas is.\u201D The developer is not
    liable for technical issues, connection interruptions, or data loss.\n\nThe developer
    reserves the right to modify, update, or discontinue the game without prior notice.\n\n6.
    Violation Handling\n\nPlayers who violate the terms may be warned, temporarily
    suspended, or permanently banned from the game.\n\nThe developer\u2019s decisions
    regarding violations are final.\n\n7. Amendments to Terms\n\nThe developer reserves
    the right to revise or add to these terms at any time.\n\nContinued participation
    in the game after changes signifies acceptance of the new terms."
