  m_text: 'Privacy Policy


    1. Information Collection


    The game may collect
    certain basic information such as:


    Account information (username, email
    if registered).


    Device data (device type, operating system, language, IP
    address).


    In-game activity information (achievements, scores, progress).


    The
    game does not collect sensitive personal information such as ID numbers, bank
    accounts, or external service passwords.


    2. Purpose of Information Use


    Maintain
    game operations (save progress, leaderboards).


    Improve player experience,
    fix bugs, and upgrade services.


    Ensure safety, prevent fraud, and enforce
    terms of use.


    3. Information Sharing


    Information is only used internally
    within the game.


    It is not shared with third parties except in cases where:


    Required
    by competent legal authorities.


    Necessary for service operation (e.g.,
    servers, cloud storage services).


    4. Data Security


    Data is securely
    stored on servers or within device memory.


    We apply technical measures
    to protect data from loss, unauthorized access, or misuse.


    5. Player Rights


    Players
    have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of their personal
    information (if any).


    Players may stop using the game at any time, which
    also means stopping the sharing of new data.


    6. Policy Changes


    This
    policy may be updated to comply with new laws and regulations.


    Continued
    use of the game after changes indicates acceptance of the new policy.


    7.
    Contact


    For any questions or requests related to this Privacy Policy, please
    contact us via support email: [insert your email].'
